          "artist_url": "https://ccmixter.org/people/jlbrock44",
          "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/"
        }
      ],
      "author_note": "I picked Spinningmerkaba! This felt like serendipity in that we've been working quite a lot together as ccM admins behind-the-scenes... and this gave me the chance to explore his catalog and get immersed in our initial connection... music! \r\n\r\nI was immediately drawn to Spin's \"Space Bubble Acoustic\" sample and knew it would be the foundation. I definitely had to include one of his trumpet samples (we are both brass enthusiasts)... so I pitch shifted, doubled, and mutated his \"Muted Trumpet\"... all this transmutation led to more shifts and metamorphosis... which, of course, was all sorts of creative fun.\r\n\r\nAnd so... I hope you dig, Jason. It is an absolute joy working with you as an admin and friend.\r\n\r\nAnd, of course, I hope you dig, ccMixter friends!",
      "processing": "Original MP3, unchanged",
      "verification": "FFmpeg full decode: success"
    },
